.NET / Windows Agent (services/windows-agent)
---------------------------------------------
NuGet packages are restored at build time. License information for each package
is available from the NuGet gallery entry and under the user's NuGet cache
(e.g. %USERPROFILE%\.nuget\packages) for the versions referenced in *.csproj.

Key runtime libraries include (non-exhaustive): Microsoft.WindowsAppSDK,
System.Text.Json, and test packages (xunit, etc.) where applicable.

